Laadki Guitar Chords with strumming pattern from Bollywood Hindi movie Angrezi Medium, sung by Rekha Bhardwaj.

Capo on 1st fret (Buy Capo)

Strumming Pattern: DUD D D

[C]Oh ri oh chiraiya tu,        [C]Kal subah udd jaana re
[Dm]Aaj ki raat reh [F]ja na [G]mere [C]paas,        [F]Ho aaj ki raat ruk ja na mere [C]paas

[C]Galiyan aur chaubare saare,        [Dm]Dekhenge teri baat re
[F]Na aayi jo to karenge hum [C]fariyad

[C]Teri laadki main, [F]laadki main,        [C]Teri laadki main, [F]laadki main
Teri [C]laadki main [F]chhodugi na tera [C]hath

[C]Dori kheenchi dori,        Palne ki [F]toone mori
Mere [G]sapnon ko [F]jhulaya [G]saari [C]raat,        [C]Bhale bagiya teri chhodi
Bhale nindiyan teri [F]chori,        Bas [G]itti baat to [F]rakhiyo [G]meri [C]yaad

[C]Teri laadki main, [F]laadki main,        Teri [C]laadki main, [F]laadki main
Teri [C]laadki main [F]chhodugi na tera [C]hath
